Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:42.16,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{R-Right.}A-Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:45.04,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Why don't we pick those up?}Nhặt nó lên trước nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.46,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{H-Huh?}À!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.47,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{What the heck is going on?}Chuyện quái gì thế này?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:56.22,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Is this some new extortion tactic?}Một cách tống tiền mới à?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:02.25,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Or, wait... Is she...}Khoan...cậu ta...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.02,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Do you like this stuff?}Cậu thích mấy thứ này hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.13,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Games, I mean.}Game ấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.17,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{O-Of course, right?}D-Dĩ nhiên.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.25,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I knew that!}Biết rồi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:13.86,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I knew, but I was getting flustered on purpose!}do nãy giờ run quá nên tớ hơi khó hiểu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.60,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Er, uh... never mind.}A...không có gì.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.24,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Sorry.}Xin lỗi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:20.96,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{This is the one you picked up earlier, right?}Trò này là cậu lấy vừa nãy nhỉ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:23.54,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Wait, that's—}Khoan, đó là--
