Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.55,sign_5049_65_Wardrobe_malfunc,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}{Sexiness-Packed Adventure}Có kèm cảnh nóng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:31.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{"Wardrobe malfunctions included."}Có tủ quần áo luôn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:32.55,sign_5049_66_Something_missin,Text,0,0,0,,{Wardrobe malfunctions \Nincluded <3}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:33.61,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I love it!}Tớ thích!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:35.86,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I mean... games in general!}À ý tớ là...trò chơi này!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:36.92,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{O-Of course, right?}A-À ừ!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:37.78,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I knew that.}Tớ biết mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:41.89,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I knew, but I was getting flustered on purpose.}Tớ cũng biết thế nên có hơi bối rối.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:51.07,sign_5430_78_Sell_Us_Your_Gam,Text,0,0,0,,{Sell Us Your Games}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:51.07,sign_5430_78_Sell_Us_Your_Gam2,Text,0,0,0,,{We Buy High}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.86,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I want to disappear without a trace.}Mình muốn biến mất.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:55.50,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I, uh, like games.}T-Tớ thích chơi game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:59.87,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{That game had some unique content, \Nso I was a bit interested.}Do nó rất vui và độc đáo nên tớ thích.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:04.38,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{So I couldn't help but want \Nto read the back cover.}Thế nên tớ thường hay tò mò đọc bìa sau.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:06.60,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Oh, I get it.}Vậy à.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:09.26,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Package back covers are \Npretty interesting, right?}Nghe thú vị nhỉ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.35,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{You get it?}Cậu hiểu hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:14.09,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It's great, isn't it?}Tuyệt lắm đúng không?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:17.81,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{The way they jam-pack all of the game's \Nselling points into that small space.}Cách họ nhét hết nội dung vào cái bìa sau đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.30,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It's irresistible!}Thật không thể cưỡng lại.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:21.44,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Oh, yeah, speaking of back covers...}A, nói về bìa sau...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:24.51,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Crap.}Chết.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:27.65,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{She's totally creeped out.}Cậu ấy đang sợ hãi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.61,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,Tendou-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.09,0:04:34.84,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I didn't mean to interrupt.}Xin lỗi, tớ không cố ý làm gián đoạn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:38.01,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You were just so passionate, Amano-kun.}Vì thấy cậu đang rất phấn khích.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:41.87,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Also... How do I put it?}Hơn nữa...nói sao nhỉ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:45.29,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You're just so perfect.}Cậu thật hoàn hảo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:52.17,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Hey, if it's all right with you... \N}{\i1}{If}{\i0}{ it's all right with you...}Nè, nếu được...nếu được...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:55.47,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Would you join me...}Cậu tham gia...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:59.45,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{in the game club?}CLB Game với tớ nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:01.39,sign_7140_100_Would_you_join_m,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)}{Would you join me\Nin the game club?}Tham gia CLB Game (chứ mày tưởng gì :))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:02.20,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Huh?}Hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:02.77,sign_7227_101_Huh_,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}Hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:04.89,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Tsumo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:04.89,sign_7302_104_TSUMO,,0,0,0,,{TSUMO}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:06.27,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{Woohoo!}Ngon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:08.11,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Sanbaiman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.77,Main Dialogue,B,0,0,0,,{Not bad.}Không tệ.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.91,Main Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,{You little...}Thằng này...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:12.74,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Hey, Tasuku...}Này, Tasuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.33,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Isn't this amazing?}Cái này dễ thương quá nhỉ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.60,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{What, so you want me to get it?}Thế, muốn tớ lấy à?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.45,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Yup!}Ừm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:27.06,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{You're mega-good at gaming.}Cậu chơi game cực giỏi mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.54,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Uh, mega-good?}Cực giỏi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:32.38,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Get it for me, please, Tasuku?}Nhé, Tasuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:37.01,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{I mean, I guess I could.}À, ừm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:42.22,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Come on, money.}Tiền?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.71,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,T-Tasuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:46.64,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{This girl...}Con này...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.56,tsukamu,,0,0,0,,{Grab}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.56,remaining,,0,0,0,,{Plays \NRemaining}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:54.53,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Go, go, Tasuku! Yay! Yay!}Cố lên Tasuku! Hú hú!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:00.29,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{A little more to the right.}Chút nữa thôi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:00.93,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{That's it.}Đúng rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:02.22,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{There, there!}Ở đó!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:03.47,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Shut up.}Im đi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:05.26,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Quit talking and watch.}Nhìn tớ chơi thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.61,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{What are you doing, Tasuku?}Làm gì thế Tasuku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:12.02,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{You suck!}Kém quá!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:21.10,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:25.55,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Oh my God, it's so fluffy!}Nó mềm quá nè!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:27.66,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{You sure are good at games!}Cậu đúng là giỏi thật!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:29.94,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Don't get too excited.}Đừng có phấn khích nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:35.76,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{I'm so badass, as always.}Mình vẫn bá như mọi khi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:36.69,sign_9481_133_Fail,Text,0,0,0,,{Fail}Loser
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:39.78,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Plus, I have a girlfriend who might not\N have much going on in her head,}Hơn nữa, mình có bạn gái ngu ngu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:43.45,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{but who you could say is cute as hell.}nhưng cứ mở mồm ra là auto dễ thương.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:47.47,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Dude, I'm such a winner. Right?}Mình là thằng giỏi nhất rồi nhỉ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.58,sign_9770_137___He_ll_soon_fai,Text,0,0,0,,{* He'll soon fail even harder.}*Bệnh nặng cần chữa trị.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:56.35,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Why are you so happy?}Có thế thôi cũng vui à?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:59.34,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{Because you got this for me.}Vì cậu gắp tặng tớ mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:02.26,Main Dialogue,D,0,0,0,,{I'm going to cherish it for life.}Tớ sẽ yêu nó suốt đời.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:08.35,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Isn't he in my class?}Thằng này trong lớp mình?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.32,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Amano, was it?}Amano thì phải.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:13.12,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{The guy who's gaming all the time.}Thằng lúc nào cũng chơi game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:17.61,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{What the hell is he even \Ndoing over there, anyway?}Cơ mà nó làm gì ở đây?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:19.99,Main Dialogue,Aguri,0,0,0,,{What's up, Tasuku?}Sao thế Tasuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:21.61,Main Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Nothing.}Không.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:25.87,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,{Guys like him will never have \Na hot girlfriend like mine.}Mấy thằng như nó chẳng bao giờ có bạn gái dễ thương đâu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:25.87,sign_10643_148_Hot_girlfriend,Text,0,0,0,,{Hot girlfriend}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.64,Italics Dialogue,Tasuku,0,0,0,,Loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:28.64,sign_10733_150_Said_loser,Text,0,0,0,,{Said loser}Thằng loser thứ 2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:29.68,sign_10757_151_and_the__hot_gir,Text,0,0,0,,{and the \Nhot girlfriend} và bạn gái dễ thương
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:31.12,sign_10782_152_will_come_to_mee,Text,0,0,0,,{will later meet in secret \Nmany times.}sau này sẽ NTR mày :)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:37.63,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{So I ended up creating it by myself,}Thế nên tớ định tự mình làm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:40.82,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{but I haven't really recruited \Nmembers or anything yet.}Nhưng lại chưa có thành viên tham gia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:43.22,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I-Is that so?}V-Vậy à?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:45.60,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{So polite.}Kính ngữ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.03,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I don't get it.}Tớ cũng chả hiểu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:51.79,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Even my classmates talk to me politely.}Sao ai cũng dùng kính ngữ với mình?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.54,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I-Is that so?}V-Vậy sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:54.37,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Yup.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:57.57,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Even my teacher talked to me \Nin polite language the other day.}Ngay cả giáo viên cũng thế.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:02.81,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Heck, even King Koopa \Ntalks to me in polite language.}Thậm chí vua Koopa cũng dùng kính ngữ nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:04.05,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Wow...}Vậy à...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:06.07,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Wait, no, that one's a lie!}Khoan, làm gì có chuyện đó!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.04,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{No, it's true.}Không, là thật đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:11.22,sign_11702_166_I_thank_you_for_,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}{I thank you for visiting me\Nin this treacherous weather.}Thật quý hóa khi ghé thăm tôi trong thời tiết này
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:13.67,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Maybe it was a bug.}Có thể nó là lỗi game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.60,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{That's obviously a bug!}Chắc chắn rồi còn gì!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:17.38,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{How do you even get that to happen?}Cơ mà sao cậu làm được?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:20.16,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Like when I pulled three all-nighters \Nin a row trying to beat}Khi tớ cố gắng kéo cả 3 tướng vào để đánh bại
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.13,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,nhằm phá kỉ lục thế giới về tốc độ giết boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:26.17,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{You were dreaming, then!}Vậy chắc cậu đang mơ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:27.89,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{That's clearly a dream!}Chắc chắn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:30.64,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{\i1}{You're}{\i0}{ the one that was glitched, Tendou-san!}Người bị lỗi là cậu đó!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.57,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I went off-topic.}Xin lỗi, chúng ta dừng nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.57,0:08:35.53,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It's okay.}K-Không sao.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:40.28,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Uh, I'm actually surprised \Nthat you like gaming.}Tớ khá ngạc nhiên khi cậu thích game đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:43.71,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I haven't really told my friends about it.}Tớ ít khi kể cho ai nghe lắm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:48.74,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Actually, I came to Otobuki because \NI'd heard it had a famous game club.}Tớ đến Otobuki vì nghe nói CLB Game nổi tiếng lắm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:53.56,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{It fell apart before we entered, though.}Nhưng nó đã giải thể khi chúng ta vào.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:57.42,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I-Is that so?}V-Vậy à?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:08:58.84,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Yeah.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:08:59.92,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{So...}Thế nên...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:02.37,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Last year,}Năm ngoái,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:08.73,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I worked behind the scenes to revive it, \Nand this year, I managed to succeed.}tớ đã cố gắng làm hết sức để khôi phục nó \Nvà nhất định năm nay thành công.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:11.00,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{C-Congratulations.}C-Chúc mừng cậu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.04,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Thank you.}Cám ơn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:16.84,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{So, uh, what exactly is the game club?}Thế CLB Game là làm gì?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.86,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Yeah, that's an obvious question to ask.}Hỏi hay đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:24.73,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{But we don't }{\i1}{just}{\i0}{ play games.}Nhưng thực ra chúng ta không chỉ chơi game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:28.01,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{We play seriously, as club work.}Chúng ta chơi game một cách nghiêm túc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:29.62,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I see.}Vậy à.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:36.18,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{So I've been looking for new members \Nwho are undeniably true gamers.}Thế nên tớ đang chiêu mộ những game thủ chân chính.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:40.35,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{That's when I found you.}Và tớ đã tìm thấy cậu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:54.06,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{So would you be willing to come visit \Nthe game club sometime? Please?}Thế nên cậu đến tham quan CLB Game nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:09:59.54,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Amano-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:05.32,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{M-Mom!}M-Mẹ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.31,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I have a curfew.}Xin lỗi. Đến giờ giới nghiêm rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.82,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Anyway, think about it.}Dù sao thì hãy suy nghĩ nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:12.33,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{See you!}Gặp cậu sau.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:15.79,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Wait for me in class after school tomorrow.}Ngày mai tớ sẽ chờ ở phòng CLB!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:17.41,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.02,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Goodbye.}Tạm biệt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:34.85,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Game club!}CLB Game!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:39.97,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Who would have thought there'd be \Nsuch a huge event in my life?}Ai ngờ cuộc đời thằng loser như mình \Nlại được sang trang mới chứ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:41.60,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{This isn't a dream, is it?}Mơ sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:43.61,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{No way... But...}Không...nhưng...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:58.94,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Oh.}À.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:10:58.93,sign_15786_213_96_seconds_remai,,0,0,0,,{96 }{\c&HE7DDCA&}{seconds remaining}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:00.62,sign_15786_210_Mono_san_is_requ,Text,0,0,0,,{Mono-san is requesting assistance.}Momo yêu cầu trợ giúp
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:00.62,sign_15786_211_Accept,Text,0,0,0,,{Accept}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:00.62,sign_15786_212_Decline,Text,0,0,0,,{Decline}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:10:59.93,sign_15786_213_96_seconds_remai,Text,0,0,0,,{95 }{\c&HE7DDCA&}{seconds remaining}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.62,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It's Mono-san.}Là Mono à?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:00.62,sign_15786_213_96_seconds_remai,Text,0,0,0,,{94 }{\c&HE7DDCA&}{seconds remaining}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:23.16,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{Let's go.}Đi thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.56,Main Dialogue,B,0,0,0,,{What do you want to do today?}Hôm nay làm gì giờ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.67,Main Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,{Want to go for karaoke again?}Karaoke nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:28.01,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I-I need to calm down.}M-Mình cần bình tĩnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:36.37,sign_16664_221_Mono_san_is__req,Text,0,0,0,,{Mono-san is \Nrequesting assistance.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:36.37,sign_16664_222_Accept,Text,0,0,0,,{Accept}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:36.37,sign_16664_223_Decline,Text,0,0,0,,{Decline}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.37,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sorry I'm late.}Xin lỗi vì tớ đến trễ nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:45.38,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It's fine! I was killing time.}Không sao! Tớ đang rảnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:49.35,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Wow, you play social network games too, huh?}Cậu chơi game online à?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:51.23,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{T-Too close!}G-Gần quá!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:54.80,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{God in Heaven!}Nhìn dữ thế!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:58.68,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{T-Tendou-san, never mind that. \NLet's just go to the club room already.}T-Tendou này, chúng ta đến CLB thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.35,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Huh?}Hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:00.42,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Oh, yeah.}À ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:02.60,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You're right. Let's go.}Đi nào.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:07.48,sign_17392_233_Request_declined,Text,0,0,0,,{Request declined.}Hết giờ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.48,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Xin lỗi, Mono.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:13.15,Italics Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{The dating sim gods have chosen me.}Thần hẹn hò đã chọn tớ.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.00,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Hello! My name is Misumi Eiichi.}Xin chào! Tớ là Misumi Eiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:24.70,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{U-Um... Tendou-san?}A...Tendou?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:26.78,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Oh, didn't I tell you?}Tớ chưa nói hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:29.85,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I had actually invited \Nanother member already.}Tớ cũng mời những người khác nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:32.83,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Misumi-kun, this is \NAmano Keita-kun from Class F.}Misumi, đây là Amano Keita lớp F.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.14,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{N-Nice to meet you.}R-Rất vui được gặp cậu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:38.96,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{He was glued to a block \Npuzzle game at the arcade.}Cậu ấy là trùm trò xếp hình đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.10,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Don't tell people that! Jeez!}Đừng nói với ai cả!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:42.64,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{It's embarrassing!}Xấu hổ lắm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:43.90,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Why?}Tại sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.58,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You were unbelievably good at it.}Cậu chơi khủng lắm mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:48.27,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{No, that's not true.}Không. Không phải.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:51.64,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I want to smack myself for \Nthinking I was the chosen one!}Muốn được đấm cho sáng mắt ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:54.40,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,Amano-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:58.81,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{You know, I don't really have many friends.}Tớ thực ra không có nhiều bạn lắm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:00.33,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{So...}Thế nên...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:05.58,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I'd be happy if we could be friends.}Rất vui được làm quen với cậu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.99,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Th-Thank you!}M-Mong cậu giúp đỡ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:13.30,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Th-Thank you, too.}T-Tớ cũng vậy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:22.93,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I'm surprised the school \Napproved of a game club, though.}Không ngờ là trường cho thành lập CLB Game đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.93,0:13:24.32,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I know.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:28.89,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{But we work more properly \Nthan you guys might think.}Nhưng bọn tớ làm việc chăm chỉ hơn các cậu nghĩ đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:29.77,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Properly?}Làm việc?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.94,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Well, seeing is believing.}Vào nhìn thử là biết.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.66,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Welcome to the game club.}Chào mừng đến CLB Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.66,Game Club1,,0,0,0,,{Game Club}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.17,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Pardon me.}Xin thứ lỗi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.13,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Wow, there really are games everywhere.}Nhiều game quá.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:59.10,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sorry. Senpai isn't very approachable.}Xin lỗi nhé. Anh ấy hơi khó bắt chuyện.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:01.00,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{You're so rude.}Đàn em ăn nói thế à?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:03.17,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{How exactly am I not approachable?}Anh mày khó bắt chuyện chỗ nào?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:05.85,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Come on! You're super unapproachable.}Không, không! Anh là quá khó ấy chứ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.31,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I'll make introductions.}Để tớ giới thiệu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:12.52,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{This wannabe-cool guy with \Nglasses is Kase Gakuto-Senpai.}Anh ngầu lòi này là Kase Gakuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:13.36,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{You...}Này...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.74,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{N-Nice to meet you.}R-Rất vui được gặp anh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:20.66,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{The lady over there playing a \Nfighting game is Oohiso Niina-senpai.}Chị đang ngồi kia là Oohiso Niina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:28.58,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Uh, as you can see, she's a bit distant \Nwhen she's playing fighting games. Yes.}Như cậu thấy, chị ấy đang rất tập trung chơi game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.65,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{That's amazing.}Tuyệt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:32.40,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You may not believe it from how he looks,}Tiện đây thì Kase-senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:35.67,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{but Kase-senpai is one of the \Ntop FPS players in the world.}nhìn thế thôi chứ là một trong \Nnhững người chơi FPS thế giới đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:36.65,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Huh...}Ờ...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.55,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{What do you mean, "from how I look"?}"Nhìn thế thôi" là sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:42.92,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Whoa, COS!}Là Halflife!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.77,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Wow.}Tuyệt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.76,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I've never seen a game like this one.}Cũng có game dạng này à.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.30,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Is this your first time \Nseeing an FPS, Misumi-kun?}Lần đầu cậu thấy game FPS à?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:51.85,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Beyond block puzzles, I'm clueless.}Tớ chỉ chuyên xếp hình thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:53.44,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{O-Oh, really?}A-À, ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:57.94,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Another headshot.}Lại headshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:15:02.72,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Also, we bought everything here \Nusing prize money from competitions.}Tiện đây thì bọn tớ mua hết chỗ này nhờ tiền thắng giải đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:03.74,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Prize money?}Tiền thắng giải?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:08.37,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{So that's what you meant when \Nyou said you work properly.}Ý cậu bảo chơi game nghiêm túc là thế nhỉ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:12.13,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Now, it's no fun just watching.}Giờ thì, chỉ xem không chán lắm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:13.56,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You guys should play, too.}Hai cậu chơi luôn đi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.09,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{Let's see what you've got.}Xem hai chú có gì nào?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:20.59,sign_22034_292_Game_1,Text,0,0,0,,{Game 1}Lần một
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.05,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{That was so fun.}Thật vui quá.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:24.97,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{One more.}Một ván nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.97,sign_22034_292_Game_1,Text,0,0,0,,{Game 5}Lần 5
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:31.99,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I'm getting a bit tired.}Em hơi mệt rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:32.99,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{We're going again.}Một lần nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:33.56,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{Get ready.}Sẵn sàng đi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:36.44,sign_22034_292_Game_1,Keita,0,0,0,,{Game 30}Lần 30
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.63,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Good work, everyone.}Làm tốt lắm, mọi người.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:40.80,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{How about a brea—}Chúng ta nên nghỉ--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:42.57,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{We're all waiting on you. Hurry up.}Nhanh lên, vào game đi chứ.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:47.95,sign_22651_304_Two_hours_later_,Text,0,0,0,,{Two hours later...}2 tiếng sau
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:53.20,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Kase-senpai, you should go easy on him.}Kase, anh làm hơi quá đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:56.94,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{In my mind, there's no such thing as \N"going easy" when it comes to FPS games.}Trong game FPS anh mày không bao giờ nương tay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:58.91,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You're such a crank.}Đấy, còn bảo dễ gần nữa đi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:01.13,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You're going to scare away our new members.}Làm thế lính mới chạy hết thì sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.47,0:16:05.40,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Y-You're awesome, though, Kase-senpai.}A-Anh tuyệt thật đấy, Kase-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.72,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{The bots were so strong, too.}Máy cũng mạnh nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.09,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{They were all scrubs.}Đám đó toàn rác.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:15.31,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{Although, is this really your \Nfirst time playing this game?}Cơ mà lần đầu chơi game này à?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:18.73,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{I've never had a newbie \Nkill me three times before.}Chưa có lính mới nào giết anh mày được 3 mạng đâu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:19.34,sign_23480_314_POINTS,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,100)}{POINTS  KILLS  ASSISTS  DEATHS}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:21.95,sign_23480_315_KILLS,Text,0,0,0,,{KILLS        ASSISTS        DEATHS}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:23.95,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I-I just got lucky.}E-Em chỉ may mắn thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:27.20,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I was imitating your motions, that's all.}Em chỉ là phán đoán nước đi của anh thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.23,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{That's amazing, Misumi-kun!}Misumi tuyệt quá!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:31.47,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Are you sure you haven't played before?}Cậu chắc đây là lần đầu chứ!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:34.26,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Yeah, this really is my first time.}Ừm, lần đầu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.21,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{It turns out it's surprisingly fun, huh?}Đúng là chơi thử thấy thú vị quá.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:38.75,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{This is huge, Misumi-kun!}Quá tuyệt đó, Misumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:41.13,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{You're embarrassing me.}Tớ hơi xấu hổ đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.83,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{You actually have promise.}Cậu có tài đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:47.46,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{The observational skills to steal \Ntechniques from other players}Khả năng quan sát để học theo kĩ năng người khác
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:50.34,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{are an absolute requirement \Nfor becoming better at FPS games.} rất cần thiết để trở thành người chơi FPS giỏi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.16,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Thank you.}Cám ơn anh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.90,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{On the other hand...}Và...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:54.85,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{You.}Cậu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:55.98,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Y-Yes?}V-Vâng?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.98,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{What the hell were you doing, \Njumping up and down on the car?}Lúc nãy tại sao cứ nhảy nhảy trên xe thế?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:05.61,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Oh, I thought I might get to see \Nsome really pretty scenery.}A, em nghĩ mình sẽ nhìn thấy khung cảnh tuyệt đẹp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:09.31,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{Can't you tell you're making \Nthings harder for your team?}Thế cậu có biết chơi đồng đội không?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:15.87,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I-It's okay. Senpai is just really passionate \Nwhen it comes to FPS games.}K-Không sao. Anh ấy chỉ là hơi gắt trong mấy trò FPS thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:17.32,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sorry, Amano-kun.}Xin lỗi, Amano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:18.61,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I-It's fine.}K-Không sao.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:25.09,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Wh-Why don't we all take a break, okay?}C-Chúng ta nghỉ một chút nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:35.79,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{It feels so nice.}Tuyệt quá.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:38.60,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I'm impressed.}Tuyệt thật đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:40.52,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{After all the playing we just did...}Vừa mới chơi xong mà đã...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:44.12,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{They both really love gaming.}Cả hai bọn họ rất thích chơi game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:46.72,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{More than they love eating every day, even.}Hơn cả ngày ăn 3 bữa nữa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:47.86,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Uh-huh.}A-ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:54.53,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{By the way, why did you guys become gamers?}Mà tại sao hai cậu lại chơi game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:56.25,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Why?}Tại sao à?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.29,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Yeah.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:59.38,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Did you have a specific reason?}Có lý do gì đặc biệt không?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.13,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{A reason?}Lý do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:06.04,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Kase-senpai was trained really hard \Nby his mercenary dad as a kid,}Anh Kase từ bé đã được đào tạo\N bài bản từ cha làm lính của mình.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:08.64,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{so he became crazy good at FPS games.}Thế nên anh ấy mới mạnh vậy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:13.68,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Niina-senpai is apparently bettering herself\Nto try to bring her best friend}Chị Niina thì dường như cố gắng giỏi hơn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.39,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{back from the dark side.}để cứu lấy người bạn từ phía bên kia thế giới.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:17.02,Game Club,Text,0,0,0,,{Game Club}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:17.02,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{What's the deal with this club?}Cái CLB quái gì thế này?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:19.45,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Uh, I...}À, tớ...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:20.51,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Yeah?}Sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.26,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I just kind of like gaming.}Chỉ là thích chơi game thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:30.03,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{What's with this vibe?}Sao tự nhiên trầm thế?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.03,0:18:31.69,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Oh, of course.}A, thế à?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:33.66,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{That's a good reason, too.}L-Lý do được đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:34.98,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{What about you, Misumi-kun?}C-Còn cậu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:38.40,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I, uh... What can I say?}À...tớ phải nói sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:41.07,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I don't have a very good reason, either.}Lý do cũng không có gì đâu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.63,0:18:42.92,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Thank goodness.}May quá.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:47.49,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I lost all of my memories, and the only thing \NI was good at was that block puzzle.}Tớ đã mất hết kí ức và những gì còn lại chỉ là giỏi xếp hình.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:50.77,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Sorry, that kind of killed the conversation.}Xin lỗi vì đã nói mấy điều kì lạ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:53.15,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Traitor!}Tên phản bội!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:53.81,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Everyone's got their own reasons, huh?}Ai cũng có lý do của riêng mình mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.39,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:19:00.99,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{S-So, guys, do you have a better idea \Nof what the game club is about now?}V-Vậy, hai cậu có ý nào để xây dựng CLB game không?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:01.46,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Yes.}Vâng.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.57,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Y-Yes.}À-ừ.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:03.46,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Yup.}Ừm ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.98,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I'm sure our senpai were a bit scary,}Tớ nghĩ mấy anh chị ấy có hơi đáng sợ,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:09.28,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{but they're basically just game addicts, \Nso don't let them get to you.}nhưng cơ bản là do cuồng game nên đừng bận tâm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:14.03,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You don't have to be really good \Nat gaming or anything, either.}Các cậu không cần phải ép mình chơi game giỏi đâu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:19.29,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{The game club's mission is just to \Nmake ourselves better gamers.}Nhiệm vụ của CLB Game chỉ là làm chúng ta chơi tốt hơn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:25.42,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{So I just want us to really work hard at it.}Thế nên tớ chỉ muốn mọi người chơi game nghiêm túc thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.35,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Yes.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.27,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{I had a lot of fun today.}Tớ đã rất vui hôm nay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:29.97,Main Dialogue,Eiichi,0,0,0,,{Please let me join.}Hãy cho tớ tham gia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.40,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Thanks!}Cám ơn cậu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.68,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{What about you, Amano-kun?}Còn cậu, Amano?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:35.68,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Would you be in the game club with me?}Tham gia CLB Game nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:40.81,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,Tendou-san... Misumi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:42.49,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{You're going to need help.}Thiệt tình...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:45.86,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,{I'll teach you the basics of FPS games.}Anh sẽ dạy chú chơi FPS thật tốt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:53.74,Main Dialogue,Gakuto,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:58.24,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{My first friends since I started high school.}Những người bạn đầu tiên của mình.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:02.50,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{They're a bit hard to talk to, \Nbut they're kind.}Họ có hơi khó tính như rất tốt bụng.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:05.82,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{And Tendou-san's smile...}Và nụ cười của Tendou...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:12.47,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{An ideal school life, surrounded \Nby my beloved games.}Một cuộc sống lý tưởng, bao quanh bởi những game yêu thích.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:15.41,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Could things get any better?}Còn gì tuyệt hơn?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:21.83,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{No, thank you. I'll pass.}Không, cảm ơn. Em không tham gia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:24.27,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It doesn't look like this club plays \Nany of the games I want to.}CLB này không có trò em thích.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:26.77,Main Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,{Huh?}Hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:35.06,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{You idiot!}Mày bị ngu à?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:35.64,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Why?}Tại sao?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:36.75,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Why did you turn it down?}Sao mày lại từ chối?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:38.65,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Wasn't it the invitation of my dreams?}Mày đang phá đi giấc mơ à?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:40.43,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{What am I, stupid? Am I dead?}Mày bị ngu à? Mày chết đi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:47.06,sign_29882_408_20_seconds_remai,,0,0,0,,{20}{\c&HE7DDCA&}{ seconds remaining}20 giây
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.54,sign_16664_221_Mono_san_is__req,Text,0,0,0,,{Mono-san is requesting assistance.}Mono yêu cầu trợ giúp
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.54,sign_16664_222_Accept,Text,0,0,0,,{Accept}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.54,sign_16664_223_Decline,Text,0,0,0,,{Decline}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:48.07,sign_29882_408_20_seconds_remai,Text,0,0,0,,{19}{\c&HE7DDCA&}{ seconds remaining}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.07,0:20:48.54,sign_29882_408_20_seconds_remai,,0,0,0,,{18}{\c&HE7DDCA&}{ seconds remaining}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.73,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,T-Tendou-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:56.57,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You're still playing that, huh?}Cậu vẫn đang chơi à?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:59.60,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{N-Never mind that.}Q-Quan trọng hơn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.83,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I still want you in our club, Amano-kun.}Tớ vẫn muốn cậu tham gia CLB, Amano.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.23,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Please?}Nhé?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:07.04,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{I'm kind of interested in you.}Tớ để ý cậu lắm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:47.92,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{That was close.}Xém nữa thì...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:50.12,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{We're safe for now.}Chúng ta an toàn rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:53.61,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,A-Amano-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:57.90,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{N-No... I'm sorry! You were talking!}K-Không phải...xin lỗi cậu! Đang nói chuyện vậy mà...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.87,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Ugh, how could I be so rude?}Sao tớ có thể thất lễ thế chứ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.62,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Th-Then...}T-Thế...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:09.14,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry, though.}Tớ xin lỗi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:12.50,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I can't join the game club.}Không tham gia đâu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:17.50,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{A-Are you worried that you \Nmight not be good enough?}C-Cậu lo rằng mình không giỏi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:22.11,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{In that case, don't worry. Kase-senpai takes \Ngood care of people, believe it or not.}Thế đừng lo, Kase-senpai sẽ hướng dẫn tận tình mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:25.12,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{No, that's not it.}Không phải.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:26.46,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{It's not about that.}Không phải việc đó.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:28.02,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Then what is it?}Thế là gì?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:35.28,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I want to play games for the enjoyment.}Tớ muốn chơi game mình thích.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:39.12,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I guess I found out that I don't like \Nplaying for the competition.}Và tớ cũng không thích chơi game thi đấu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:44.97,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{So, um... I'm sorry, Tendou-san.}Thế nên là...xin lỗi cậu, Tendou.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.97,0:22:50.54,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I think the game club is fantastic, but I \Nwant to keep gaming the way I like to play.}Tớ nghĩ CLB game rất tuyệt nhưng\N tớ vẫn muốn chơi theo ý mình.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:55.05,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Why do I feel like I was just rejected?}Tại sao cậu lại từ chối tớ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.05,0:22:58.72,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Oh, but I'm really happy you invited me.}A, tớ cũng vui vì cậu đã mời.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:00.18,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Thank you.}Cám ơn cậu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.18,0:23:02.72,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You're nothing to me.}Cậu chẳng là gì với tớ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.72,0:23:04.14,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{You suck at games.}Chơi game cũng tệ.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.69,0:23:08.69,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{It's not like I enjoyed spending time with you...}Không phải là tớ muốn chơi game cùng cậu... (tsun tsun)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.69,0:23:11.68,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Keep up the good work at the game club.}Từ giờ hãy cố gắng phát triển CLB Game của cậu nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.68,0:23:12.69,Main Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{I'm rooting for you.}Tớ sẽ ủng hộ.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:16.15,Main Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,{Sure, you're right.}Ừm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.75,0:23:36.58,Italics Dialogue,Keita,0,0,0,,{Did I make her angry?}Mình làm cậu ta giận à?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.51,0:23:45.97,sign_34083_444_Message_from_Mon,Text,0,0,0,,{Message from Mono-san}Tin nhắn từ Mono
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.51,0:23:45.97,sign_34083_445_Thanks_again,Text,0,0,0,,{Thanks again}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.97,0:23:47.97,sign_34083_445_Thanks_again,,0,0,0,,


